# Objective 1: a hospital records policy that uses every part of the language:
# declarations, SUPPORTS, ALLOW and DENY, all four actions (ACCESS = every
# supported action), and conditions with AND, OR, NOT and parentheses.
# Expected: compiles with 0 errors and 0 warnings.
SUBJECT doctor, nurse, receptionist, auditor, contractor

RESOURCE patient_records SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE billing         SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE lab_system      SUPPORTS READ, EXECUTE

ALLOW doctor ACCESS patient_records WHEN on_shift AND (mfa OR hospital_network)
ALLOW nurse READ patient_records WHEN on_shift
ALLOW receptionist READ billing
ALLOW auditor READ billing WHEN NOT audit_freeze
ALLOW doctor EXECUTE lab_system WHEN on_shift
DENY contractor ACCESS patient_records
